{"overview":{"Symbol":"CXAI","Name":"CXApp Inc.","Description":"CXApp Inc. provides experience solutions and delivering enterprise-grade software in the United States, Canada, and the Philippines. It offers CXAI Platform, which provides a comprehensive suite of tools to create smarter workplaces; CXAI Apps, a multi-platform suite of applications that offers personalized workflows; CXAI BTS (Behind the Scenes), a core AI engine that powers workflow automation, content management, and security compliance controls; and CXAI-VU, a generative AI analytics platform that provides actionable insights into workplace utilization, employee engagement, and operational efficiency. The company serves software/technology, financial services, next-gen auto manufacturing, entertainment, and life science companies. The company was formerly known as KINS Technology Group Inc. and changed its name to CXApp Inc. in March 2023. CXApp Inc. is headquartered in Palo Alto, California.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqCM","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Technology","Industry":"Software - Application","Address":"Four Palo Alto Square, Palo Alto, CA, 94306, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"5913406","EBITDA":"-13001000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"8.265","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-27","RevenuePerShareTTM":"5.242","ProfitMargin":"0","OperatingMarginTTM":"-2.43152","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.29906","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-1.31893","RevenueTTM":"4780000","GrossProfitTTM":"3740000","DilutedEPSTTM":"-27","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.385","AnalystTargetPrice":"15","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"-4.2879663","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"1.2371142","PriceToBookRatio":"0.306098","EVToRevenue":"0.972","EVToEBITDA":"-0.357","Beta":"0.923","52WeekHigh":"52","52WeekLow":"2.39","50DayMovingAverage":"4.7561","200DayMovingAverage":"9.800775","SharesOutstanding":"2337407","DividendDate":"","ExDivide